# The root build context is used by web/Dockerfile (which needs web/, l10n/messages and
# api/openapi.json) and by ci/rust-ci-arm64cross.Dockerfile (which needs the toolchain
# pin and the Skia fetch script). Allowlist those; keep everything else (target/, .git,
# crates) out of the context upload.
*
!web
!l10n/messages
!api/openapi.json
!rust-toolchain.toml
!ci/skia-binaries.sh
web/node_modules
web/.output
web/dist
web/src/api/gen
web/src/paraglide
